## 2. Product Requirements & Feature Specifications

### 2.1 User Personas & Use Cases
| Persona | Goals | Key Pain Points Solved |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Independent Developers** | Bootstrap full-stack applications in minutes with robust CI/CD and DB layers | Replaces repetitive boilerplate configuration; eliminates manual Docker/Auth/DB wiring |
| **Freelancers & Agencies** | Rapidly prototype and deliver custom websites tailored to client references | Clone-to-code pipeline turns live competitor sites into customizable architecture |
| **Enterprise & Privacy Teams** | Generate internal tooling and portals in air-gapped environments | 100% offline local inference with Ollama ensures zero data leaves local infrastructure |
| **Non-Technical Founders** | Translate business concepts into working software prototypes | Plain-English conversational generation with one-click preview and export |

