## 3. System Architecture & Monorepo Topology

AWB is orchestrated using **Turborepo** with **pnpm workspaces** for sub-second builds, strict module boundaries, and shared code reuse.

```
ai-web-builder/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/                          # Next.js 15 App Router Browser Experience
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── app/                  # Route layouts, globals, page controllers
│   │   │   └── components/           # UI views: Builder, Layers, Clone, Preview, Settings
│   │   └── package.json
│   └── desktop/                      # Electron 34 Native Desktop Shell
│       ├── electron/                 # IPC main process, security preload bridge, menus
│       └── package.json
├── packages/
│   ├── core/                         # Core Business Logic & Orchestration Engine
│   │   ├── src/providers/            # 10+ AI provider drivers & connection testing
│   │   ├── src/generator/            # Prompt builder, file parser, layer applier
│   │   ├── src/layers/               # 13-layer definitions, options schema & code injectors
│   │   ├── src/clone/                # BFS crawler, DOM parser, context synthesizer
│   │   ├── src/assets/               # SVG generators, Pexels, Unsplash, ComfyUI drivers
│   │   ├── src/settings/             # Zod validation schema & default configurations
│   │   └── src/templates/            # 10 curated starter blueprints
│   ├── ui/                           # Shared design system components (Tailwind CSS 4)
│   └── config/                       # Central application constants, ports, engine settings
├── unraid/                           # Community Applications XML templates
├── docker-compose.yml                # Production multi-container bundle (Web + Ollama)
├── docker-compose.dev.yml            # Development hot-reload configuration
└── pnpm-workspace.yaml               # Monorepo workspace configuration
```

