## 12. Product Roadmap & Future Milestones

- **v0.3.0**: Real-time token streaming with live side-by-side component diffing.
- **v0.4.0**: Interactive visual drag-and-drop canvas overlay on top of generated React components.
- **v0.5.0**: One-click direct deployment integrations to Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, and GitHub Pages.
- **v1.0.0 (GA)**: Multi-agent generation pipeline (Design Agent, Architecture Agent, QA/Testing Agent, Security Auditor) running concurrently on local LLMs.
